  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "White light charges down into the jade light pit and forms a male Gu Immortal who greets Liu Luo as brother. He is Liu Chang, a rank seven Gu Immortal whose battle strength is not lower than Ye Lui Qun Xing, and Liu tribe has no rank eight Gu Immortals at that time. He cultivates light path and specializes in speed and movement, able to retreat or advance easily. He dotes on his little sister Liu Luo from a young age, even giving her lifespan Gu, and obtains the wood path battlefield killer move she uses as a defending trump card. Sent to capture Liu Guan Yi, he still escorts Liu Luo back first and warns the assisting immortals that harm to his sister will be taken out on them.",
      "chapters": [
        1209
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_liu_luo",
        "char_ye_lui_qun_xing",
        "fac_liu_tribe",
        "gu_lifespan_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He has a skinny body, a sharp face, and bean-like eyes, arriving in white light that suppresses even the sun’s radiance.",
      "chapters": [
        1209
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Outside a Gu formation he is named a rank seven light path expert while three Liu tribe Gu Immortals fail to deduce Liu Guan Yi. Ordered to kill Liu Guan Yi and under tribe pressure for not chasing earlier when he stayed for his sister’s safety, he seeks Tian Xia Xin at Myriad Bean Garden, gets half the payment returned when that wisdom path immortal also fails, and swears deep killing intent as he leaves.",
      "chapters": [
        1211
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "deduction-hunt",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_formation",
        "char_tian_xia_xin",
        "loc_myriad_bean_garden"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With Liu Luo he approaches after Hei Lou Lan defeats Yin Wu Que, invites Fairy Black Moon to join Liu tribe as an external supreme elder, and is a famous rank seven expert of Northern Plains whose strength far exceeds Liu Luo’s. When Hei Lou Lan strikes them both, he stabilizes, protests the attack on Liu tribe Gu Immortals, then takes Liu Luo away after they are beaten, vowing to repay the shame later while holding back because she keeps targeting his sister.",
      "chapters": [
        2170
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "black-moon-conflict",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "char_yin_wu_que",
        "reg_northern_plains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After that clash he publicly challenges Fairy Black Moon as a famous rank seven expert of Northern Plains’ righteous path, using light horse crossing to keep distance and bedazzlement to blank her vision before a dark capital strength biao leaves him unconscious in a crater. Liu Luo carries him away while a Liu tribe elder pays cultivation resources into treasure yellow heaven after the loss.",
      "chapters": [
        2188
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "public-challenge",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
